& [PlanningCoordinationPack: FSC2PlanningCoordinationPackV1] is the accepted boundary pack exported by FSC2
  + [pack_id] is fsc2-planning-coordination-pack-v1
  + [pack_uuid] is 0444bea4-a0e2-4055-bd03-adaf9ab1954a
  + [source_chunk] is FSC2 planning coordination
  + [export_status] is accepted_boundary_input
  + [consumer_chunk] is FSC3 runtime graph proof
  + [activation_effect] is FSC3 may be final-sliced
  + [implementation_effect] is no runtime graph implementation is authorized by this pack alone

  = must: treat FSC1 foundation contracts as imported authority and FSC2 planning coordination contracts as packetization and coordination authority
  = must: keep runtime graph work behind FSC3 slice minting and proof fixtures
  = must: preserve SOP-first interruption for ambiguity, authority conflict, stale input, contested claims, and false-ready gates
  - never: treat LangGraph checkpoint state as source authority

& [ExportedPlanningReadinessContract] is the readiness contract exported by FSC2
  + [operator_contract] is planning_readiness_recompute v1
  + [readiness_result] is ready_to_packetize
  + [readiness_result] is blocked
  + [readiness_result] is stale
  + [readiness_result] is contradicted
  + [readiness_result] is ambiguous
  + [readiness_result] is faulted
  + [output_record_kind] is readiness_projection
  + [output_record_kind] is stale_projection
  + [output_record_kind] is support_gap
  + [output_record_kind] is proof_result
  + [output_record_kind] is fault_record
  + [output_record_kind] is operator_trace

  = must: prevent packet generation from any non-ready readiness result
  = must: preserve refusal outputs as records or traceable interrupts

& [ExportedWorkPacketContract] is the packetization contract exported by FSC2
  + [operator_contract] is work_packet_generation v1
  + [requires_readiness_state] is ready_to_packetize
  + [requires_dependency_closure] is true
  + [requires_verification_oracle] is true
  + [requires_model_route] is true
  + [requires_completion_review] is true
  + [requires_support_delta_obligation] is true
  + [requires_requirement_delta_obligation] is true
  + [forbidden_effect] is assignment
  + [forbidden_effect] is dispatch
  + [forbidden_effect] is execution
  + [forbidden_effect] is live operations control

  = must: treat work_packet as a bounded work view, not a command
  = must: keep generated packets staleable by accepted input, readiness, packet, coordination, and review changes

& [ExportedCoordinationContract] is the coordination contract exported by FSC2
  + [contract] is CoordinationClaimLifecycle
  + [contract] is CoordinationClaimBoundary
  + [operator_contract] is coordination_claim_register
  + [operator_contract] is coordination_conflict_signal
  + [contract] is RendezvousPacketContract
  + [contract] is StaleClaimRuleSet
  + [contract] is MultiAgentWorkBoundaryInvariant
  + [authority_limit] is claims coordinate work boundaries only
  + [authority_limit] is rendezvous packets are carriers and context, not signed authority by themselves

  = must: block packet execution on unresolved contested claims
  = must: preserve conversation identity and claim lineage through runtime proof work

& [ExportedCompletionGateContract] is the completion-review gate exported by FSC2
  + [operator_contract] is completion_review_delta_gate v1
  + [requires_support_delta_classification] is true
  + [requires_requirement_delta_classification] is true
  + [requires_stale_output_review] is true
  + [requires_contradiction_review] is true
  + [requires_coordination_claim_review] is true
  + [requires_fault_review] is true
  + [rebake_trigger_set] is accepted
  + [false_ready_next_gate_fault] is required

  = must: prevent follow-on work from opening until support_delta and requirement_delta are classified
  = must: preserve rebake_required before downstream work consumes changed assumptions

& [ExportedFSC2FixtureContractSet] is the verification fixture contract exported by FSC2
  + [fixture_case_count] is 11
  + [fixture_index_entry_count] is 11
  + [fixture_case] is ready_capability
  + [fixture_case] is blocked_capability
  + [fixture_case] is stale_support
  + [fixture_case] is contradicted_support
  + [fixture_case] is ambiguous_ownership
  + [fixture_case] is packet_dependency_leak
  + [fixture_case] is conflicting_claim
  + [fixture_case] is stale_claim
  + [fixture_case] is completion_support_delta
  + [fixture_case] is completion_requirement_delta
  + [fixture_case] is false_ready_next_gate

  = must: use these fixtures as FSC3 runtime graph proof cases before runtime graph nodes are trusted
  = must: keep fixture planning distinct from executable test harness work until a downstream slice authorizes it

& [FSC3ActivationBoundary] is the boundary FSC3 receives from FSC2
  + [activation_state] is open_for_slice_minting
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is FSC2PlanningCoordinationPackV1
  + [must_import] is FSC1 foundation contract pack
  + [must_import] is FSC2 boundary and invariant map
  + [must_import] is planning readiness operator contract
  + [must_import] is work packet generation contract
  + [must_import] is coordination claim and rendezvous contracts
  + [must_import] is completion review delta gate contract
  + [must_import] is FSC2 planning coordination fixture plan and index
  + [must_refine_inside_FSC3] is minimal WholeFieldPlannerGraph proof path
  + [must_refine_inside_FSC3] is checkpoint policy that treats checkpoints as execution state, not authority
  + [must_refine_inside_FSC3] is interrupt routing for SOP-first conditions
  + [must_refine_inside_FSC3] is operator trace proof and runtime fixtures

  = must: mint FSC3 final slices before implementing FSC3
  = must: keep all runtime graph proof dependencies inside FSC3 after activation
  = must: keep FSC4 surface projection gated until FSC3 runtime graph proof pack is accepted

& [PlanningCoordinationPackInvalidationRuleSet] is the staleness contract for FSC2PlanningCoordinationPackV1
  + [invalidated_by] is change to the FSC1 foundation contract pack
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any accepted FSC2 output hash
  + [invalidated_by] is change to any FSC2-S01 through FSC2-S07 completion review
  + [invalidated_by] is discovered contradiction among readiness, packetization, coordination, completion gate, or fixture expectations
  + [invalidated_by] is false-ready FSC3 runtime graph slice derived from this pack

  = must: rerun FSC2-S07 after invalidation before FSC3 consumes this pack again
